<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">ZZU POCKET</text><view class="title">连接校园</view><view class="subtitle">使用郑州大学统一身份认证账号</view>
<view wx:if="{{!sms}}"><input class="field" placeholder="学号 / 账号" value="{{account}}" data-key="account" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}"/><input class="field" placeholder="统一认证密码" password value="{{password}}" data-key="password" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button class="primary" bindtap="login" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">登录学校账号</button></view>
<view wx:else><view class="card"><view class="heading">短信验证</view><view class="small">验证码已发送至学校绑定的手机号</view></view><input class="field" type="number" maxlength="8" placeholder="短信验证码" data-key="code" value="{{code}}" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" bindtap="verify" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">验证并登录</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="resend" disabled="{{busy || cooldown > 0}}">{{cooldown > 0 ? cooldown + ' 秒后可重发' : '重新发送验证码'}}</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="restart" disabled="{{busy}}">更换账号</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card small">账号和密码经学校公钥加密后直接发送给学校认证系统。密码不保存。使用微信加密存储保持登录，学校登录状态过期或被撤销后需重新登录。<view class="divider"/>首次登录可能使「豫见郑大」下线一次。请勿连续重复尝试错误密码。</view></view>